# 🔍 Slither Static Analysis Guide

## Quick Start

```bash
# Analyze single file
slither MyContract.sol

# Analyze project  
slither .

# Analyze deployed contract (with Etherscan API)
slither 0x... --etherscan-apikey YOUR_KEY

# Output to JSON
slither . --json output.json
```

---

## Essential Detectors

### High Impact

```bash
# Reentrancy vulnerabilities
slither . --detect reentrancy-eth,reentrancy-no-eth

# Access control issues
slither . --detect suicidal,arbitrary-send-eth

# Uninitialized state variables
slither . --detect uninitialized-state

# Dangerous delegatecall
slither . --detect controlled-delegatecall
```

### Medium Impact

```bash
# Oracle issues
slither . --detect weak-prng,timestamp

# Logic errors
slither . --detect incorrect-equality,missing-zero-check

# ERC compliance
slither-check-erc . ERC20
```

### Common Detector List

| Detector | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `reentrancy-eth` | Reentrancy with ETH transfer |
| `reentrancy-no-eth` | Reentrancy without ETH |
| `reentrancy-benign` | Low-risk reentrancy |
| `uninitialized-state` | Uninitialized state variables |
| `arbitrary-send-eth` | Unrestricted ETH transfers |
| `controlled-delegatecall` | Attacker-controlled delegatecall |
| `suicidal` | Accessible selfdestruct |
| `locked-ether` | ETH locked in contract |
| `unused-return` | Unchecked return values |
| `tx-origin` | tx.origin authentication |

