## Slither Tools

### slither-check-upgradeability

```bash
# Check upgradeable contract safety
slither-check-upgradeability . MyProxy --proxy-storage-init

# Compare implementation versions
slither-check-upgradeability . MyProxy --new-version MyLogicV2
```

### slither-flat

```bash
# Flatten contracts for verification
slither-flat . --contract MyContract --strategy OneFile
```

### slither-read-storage

```bash
# Read storage slots from deployed contract
slither-read-storage 0x... --variable-name balances --rpc-url $RPC

# Read mapping value
slither-read-storage 0x... --variable-name balances --key 0xUserAddress --rpc-url $RPC
```

