## Configuration

```json
// slither.config.json
{
  "detectors_to_run": "all",
  "exclude_informational": true,
  "exclude_low": false,
  "exclude_optimization": true,
  "filter_paths": ["node_modules", "test"],
  "solc_remaps": [
    "@openzeppelin=node_modules/@openzeppelin"
  ]
}
```

