## Common Issues & Solutions

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| "Compilation failed" | Check solc version, remappings |
| Too many false positives | Use `--filter-paths`, `--exclude` |
| Missing dependencies | Install with npm/forge |
| Foundry projects | Use `slither . --foundry-out-directory out` |
